WEBVTT

00:23:28.750 --> 00:23:32.268
for adjusting in the following ways
to make sure it doesn't happen again."

00:23:32.292 --> 00:23:34.976
And that to me feels
like the foundation of trust repair.

00:23:35.000 --> 00:23:37.292
What do you think is missing
from that equation?

00:23:38.625 --> 00:23:39.976
EP: I think the first part

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:42.601
is very much the way
I like to think of it as well.

00:23:42.625 --> 00:23:45.643
It's the acknowledgment
of the wrongdoing, of the hurt,

00:23:45.667 --> 00:23:48.893
even if you think you were
legitimate and justified in what you do.

00:23:48.917 --> 00:23:52.143
I actually think that breaches of trust
are part of relationships.

00:23:52.167 --> 00:23:55.601
Relationships is connection,
disconnection, reconnection.

00:23:55.625 --> 00:23:57.768
It's harmony, disharmony, repair.

00:23:57.792 --> 00:24:01.726
It's not a problem,
it's in the nature of relationships